---
import ContactEmail from "@/components/site/ContactEmail.astro";
import PolicySection from "./PolicySection.astro";
import { link, ul } from "./styles";
---

<PolicySection title="Deleting your account">
  <ul class:list={ul}>
    <li>
      You can delete your account yourself with "Delete account" on the settings page. After you confirm, it is deleted
      right away, it cannot be restored, and you are signed out.
    </li>
    <li>
      Deleted with it: your account, your nickname, your group membership, your participation in tasks and the days or
      weeks you marked done, your sessions, the ways you sign in (password or Google) and the security log entries that
      name you.
    </li>
    <li>
      Tasks you created stay in their group with the other members' participation and the days or weeks they marked
      done. They pass to the group's owner and no longer record you as their creator.
    </li>
    <li>
      If you own a group with other members, you choose one of them to take it over before your account is deleted. If
      you are its only member, the group is deleted with its tasks and the days or weeks marked done in it.
    </li>
    <li>
      If you cannot sign in any more, write to <ContactEmail class:list={link} /> from your account's e-mail address,
      and your account is deleted the same way within one month.
    </li>
    <li>
      Request logs and error reports that contain your user id are not deleted with the account; they expire after the
      periods in "How long we keep it".
    </li>
    <li>Leaving a group keeps your account.</li>
  </ul>
</PolicySection>
